From: Ilia Snezhkov <iasnezhkov@gmail.com>
Subject: [PATCH] Cancel queued decoder inputs and drain requests on flush

Discard requests waiting for a free V4L2 input slot before the component
returns their works to the client. Otherwise the next decode submits stale
input or starts an abandoned drain, and callbacks address removed works.

diff --git a/v4l2/V4L2Decoder.cpp b/v4l2/V4L2Decoder.cpp
--- a/v4l2/V4L2Decoder.cpp
+++ b/v4l2/V4L2Decoder.cpp
@@ -574,4 +574,10 @@
     mPendingDecodeCbs.clear();
     if (mDrainCb) {
         std::move(mDrainCb).Run(VideoDecoder::DecodeStatus::kAborted);
+    }
+
+    while (!mDecodeRequests.empty()) {
+        auto request = std::move(mDecodeRequests.front());
+        mDecodeRequests.pop();
+        std::move(request.decodeCb).Run(VideoDecoder::DecodeStatus::kAborted);
     }
